# 18 Settings · 系统设置 / 园所信息（需先登录拿 token，见 ../_login.http 中 `# @name adminPasswordLogin`）

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### GET 系统设置
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{adminPasswordLogin.response.body.$.data.token}}

### PUT 系统设置（部分更新）
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{adminPasswordLogin.response.body.$.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notice": {
    "need_audit": false
  }
}

### GET 学年列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/settings/academic-years
Authorization: Bearer {{adminPasswordLogin.response.body.$.data.token}}

### POST 新学年
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/settings/academic-years
Authorization: Bearer {{adminPasswordLogin.response.body.$.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": "2026-2027",
  "semester_spring_start": "2027-02-20",
  "semester_spring_end": "2027-07-10",
  "semester_fall_start": "2026-09-01",
  "semester_fall_end": "2027-01-20"
}

### GET 园所信息
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/kindergarten/info
Authorization: Bearer {{adminPasswordLogin.response.body.$.data.token}}

### PUT 园所信息
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/kindergarten/info
Authorization: Bearer {{adminPasswordLogin.response.body.$.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "阳光幼儿园",
  "phone": "010-12345678",
  "principal": "张园长"
}
